ATTRIBUTION REQUIREMENTS

This dataset is derived from PlantUML diagrams extracted from open-source repositories indexed by the World of Code (WoC) project. When using this dataset, please:

1. Cite this dataset using its Zenodo DOI (see README.md)
2. Acknowledge the World of Code project as the data source
3. Respect the original licenses of source repositories when using individual diagrams

The metadata includes source repository URLs for each diagram to facilitate proper attribution and license verification.
